00:00:02.780 --> 00:00:04.700
Now, we're about to begin chapter four

00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:08.540
and things are really really dire.

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:11.400
To recap - we're going back up to the command center

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:13.620
to open the hangar bay doors which

00:00:13.620 --> 00:00:15.740
I don't know why we didn't do

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:16.560
but we didn't do that.

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:18.720
*reading* The ride up the elevator is tense.

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:21.260
I take a series of deep breaths, doing everything i can

00:00:21.260 --> 00:00:22.320
to stay in control.

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:24.320
Amy has gone back to her feet, but her head is pressed

00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:27.800
against the elevator wall as she supresses a series of sobs.

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:29.800
I find myself trying to remember the way those creatures

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:32.380
looked but my mind seems to shudder the effort.

00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:34.380
*continues reading*

00:01:55.120 --> 00:01:57.780
*reading* I ready the rifle, suddenly certain that there are more

00:01:57.780 --> 00:02:00.500
of those creatures waiting for us in the hallway of the Second Level.

00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:04.300
But the way is clear, allowing us to haul ass to the command center.

00:02:04.480 --> 00:02:06.960
