00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:08.520
that shows my ruined worksite.

00:02:09.020 --> 00:02:11.780
"Okay, okay," Amy says, typing commands rapidly.

00:02:11.780 --> 00:02:13.780
*continues reading*

00:02:45.820 --> 00:02:48.640
Well, I- you know what- I'm- I don't think I need to know

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:49.920
what happens in twenty minutes.

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:51.260
I think I know what happens in twenty minutes.

00:02:51.260 --> 00:02:53.400
*continues reading*

00:03:21.460 --> 00:03:25.000
Well, damn, that was a quick go of things.

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:27.200
Oh this is not gonna be good.

00:03:27.200 --> 00:03:29.140
